Incanter Elemental Wall	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_ROUNDS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_LENGTH|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_RADIUS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_PASS_DAMAGE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_ROUNDS|SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_LENGTH|20*SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_RADIUS|5*floor(SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL/2)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_PASS_DAMAGE|min(20,SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL)	DESC:Create a wall up to %1 ft long or a ring of radius up to %2 ft for %3 rounds/day (not necessarily consecutive). Choose one side and an energy type matching a known blast type: creatures within 10 ft take 2d4 damage, creatures beyond 10 ft and within 20 ft take 1d4 when it appears and each turn. Crossing deals 2d6+%4. An inverse-element hit of 20 or more damage destroys each affected 5-ft section.|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_LENGTH|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_RADIUS|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_ROUNDS|SPHERES_ELEMENTAL_WALL_PASS_DAMAGE
