Active Master of Mysteries	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Master of Mysteries	DEFINE:SPHERES_MYSTERIES_ROUNDS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_MYSTERIES_ROUNDS|SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL+SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY	DESC:Supernatural attunement: standard action to start and maintain, up to %1 rounds daily, not necessarily consecutive. Enemy magic whose line of effect passes within 60 ft must beat your magical skill defense. Failed checks reduce its caster level by the failure margin; reaching zero counters it. From level 6 failures counter the effect outright. From level 11 an immediate action redirects a countered effect, keeping its original attack roll. From level 16 store one countered effect for up to 24 hours and release it as a swift action using its original caster level and casting modifier. At level 20 maintenance becomes a move action.|SPHERES_MYSTERIES_ROUNDS